message: "If you use QuickSimsBio-UI in your research, please cite it as below."
title: QuickSimsBio-UI
abstract: >-
  A lightweight Streamlit-based user interface using QuickSimsBio and basico (the Python interface to
  COPASI). Meant for simple quick simulations of any model.
